Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:18:10 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ak820pro (dev): the lock-LED channel's handler -- a
 committed frame on the panel (type 1, now playing: both lines and the icon,
 playback off; type 2, clear), validated whole first (lockchan_media.c),
 refused for 10 s after raw HID carried any accepted media command (the lease,
 stamped at hid_protocol's text ingress, which raw81 shares); op 17 sub 7
 reads applied/rejected/leased

plans/LOCK-LED-CHANNEL-PLAN.md R2-9 and R3-2. Dev builds only, with the
receiver. scripts/lockchan_media_test.c tests the validator.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Mm219BiSCsx6uwtXcZ7a9G
